@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 健康检查：预期 HTTP 200，code 为 0
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 2. 正常发布商品：预期 HTTP 201，data 中包含商品 id，status 为 on
# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "测试商品",
  "price": 1990,
  "stock": 10,
  "category": "文具",
  "description": "VS Code 接口测试",
  "sellerName": "测试商家"
}

### 列表：预期200，可叠加keyword、status、category与分页
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?status=on&page=1&pageSize=10

### 详情：先运行上面的createProduct请求
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.id}}

### 下架：预期200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"off"}

### 重新上架后再下单
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"on"}

### 下单：预期201，金额由服务端计算
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": {{createProduct.response.body.$.data.id}},
  "quantity": 2,
  "buyerName": "Test buyer",
  "buyerPhone": "00000000000",
  "address": "Test address"
}

### 订单详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.$.data.orderNo}}

### 买家订单列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?buyerPhone=00000000000&page=1&pageSize=10

### 支付：第一次200，重复执行409/40903
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderNo":"{{createOrder.response.body.$.data.orderNo}}","method":"alipay"}

### 3. 负库存：预期 HTTP 400，code 为 40001，message 包含 stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "负库存测试商品",
  "price": 1990,
  "stock": -1,
  "category": "文具",
  "sellerName": "测试商家"
}

### 4. 字符串价格：预期 HTTP 400，code 为 40001，message 包含 price
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "错误类型测试商品",
  "price": "1990",
  "stock": 10,
  "category": "文具",
  "sellerName": "测试商家"
}
